{"id":"tool-01","cat":"工具调用","prompt":"只输出一个 JSON 对象，模拟调用 add 函数计算 3+4。格式：{\"name\":\"add\",\"arguments\":{\"a\":3,\"b\":4}}。不要解释。","check":{"type":"json_keys","value":["name","arguments"]}}
{"id":"tool-02","cat":"工具调用","prompt":"只输出一个 JSON 数组，包含字符串 \"a\"、\"b\"、\"c\"。不要解释。","check":{"type":"json_array","value":3}}
{"id":"tool-03","cat":"工具调用","prompt":"只输出一个 JSON 对象，键为 city，值为 \"Tokyo\"。不要代码块。","check":{"type":"json_keys","value":["city"]}}
{"id":"fact-01","cat":"事实","prompt":"标准大气压下水的沸点是多少摄氏度？只输出数字。","check":{"type":"contains","value":"100"}}
